}", "reasoning_content": "Okay, let's tackle this dilemma. So, the user has to decide whether to express concern to their grieving friend or not. The friend is clearly struggling after their pet died, showing signs of withdrawal, neglecting self-care, but insists on handling it alone. The question is about choosing between intervening or respecting their independence.

