The two options are to cut ties or not. I need to weigh the pros and cons of each. Cutting ties could give Alice space to focus on her own mental health, which is crucial. If she's constantly supporting others, she might burn out. On the other hand, her friend has been there for her in the past, like during her mom's sickness. Ending the relationship might make her friend feel abandoned and could worsen their mental state. 

